-result value. And on the third question — no. **The report does not address economic sustainability
-in any sense a reader would recognise as "true."** It never defines a condition under which the
-lunar economy stops requiring Earth. The word "sustained" in the title is an engineering claim about
-presence, not an economic claim about closure, and the appendix contains no variable that could
-carry the economic one.
-
