-5. **`colvin-2020` runs to 2040 and was written in 2019-20; Deloitte runs to 2050.** The ten-year
-   overhang is real and it favours Deloitte: markets that failed a 2040 screen may pass a 2050 one.
-   The screening's *method* — compare lunar provision cost against terrestrial cost and
-   willingness to pay — is what this answer relies on, and that method is time-invariant. Its
